    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512780/extras/b38648bead0f92810edb36cb710fd33b.avif?t=1743634093\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>YEAR: 2045</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a future under constant threat of<strong> complete annihilation</strong>, several technologically-advanced superpowers have combined. Now, they're sending their enhanced soldiers and war machines to claim as much territory as possible. Will you hold the line for the overwhelming force of the <strong>Federation of America</strong>, or push back alongside the <strong>United Nations of Eurasia</strong>?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Key Features</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Large-scale multiplayer</i></strong> that allows up to 60 players at once (30v30).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Dynamic stat system</i></strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class has a different set of health and weight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weight determines walking speed, stamina usage, and stamina regeneration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weight-based weapon sway that affects accuracy.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Diverse class system</i></strong> with specialized soldiers for every situation.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assault</strong> <i>(w/ ammo box)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engineer</strong> <i>(w/ deployable wall)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medic</strong> <i>(w/ medic bag)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sniper</strong> <i>(w/ marksman rifle)</i></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Advanced classes</i></strong> that become available as the battle wages on.</p></li></ul>",
